            "block_content": "Any materials developed during working hours or utilizing school supplies for use in the school program, are equally the property of the Board and the teacher, but clear title shall vest in the Board if the teacher, for any reason, terminates his employment. A teacher changing work locations within the county may retain physical possession of such materials.",
